How to build the docs:

You will need following packages installed:

  * asciidoc
  * dblatex
  * source-highlight
  * python-sphinx

(apt install ...) for Ubuntu
(yum install ...) for Fedora/CentOS

Then,

./b configure
./b build

The launcher uses Meson and writes output to build/doc/.
Alternatively, from the repository root:

meson setup build-doc -Ddpdk=false -Dsimulator=false -Ddocs=true
meson compile -C build-doc

The output is in build-doc/doc/. Add -Ddocs_pdf=false to omit PDF output.

